WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.272
A calendar shows dates. Dira tracks the promises connected to
them. When a professor

00:00:05.272 --> 00:00:10.545
moves a midterm, preparation time, an interview buffer, and a
teammate's work can all

00:00:10.545 --> 00:00:15.817
break. This public demo uses synthetic people and simulated
action tools. It never contacts

00:00:15.817 --> 00:00:16.947
a real person.

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:23.984
The email is interpreted by NVIDIA Nemotron Super on Nebius
Token Factory. Ultra proposes

00:00:23.984 --> 00:00:29.822
structured repair intents. Deterministic code checks provenance,
feasibility and policy. Slack falls from plus

00:00:29.822 --> 00:00:35.659
four point one hours to minus three point six. Delegation pauses
for authenticated approval;

00:00:35.659 --> 00:00:37.743
the model cannot grant it.

00:00:38.943 --> 00:00:44.266
After approval, Dira handles a stale interview slot, replans
within the granted policy, and

00:00:44.266 --> 00:00:49.588
reads each changed surface again. The repair restores slack to
plus one point three

00:00:49.588 --> 00:00:54.910
hours. The flight record retains rejected proposals and
recovered failures. Current reads are compared

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:57.191
with the versioned synthetic reference week.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:03.645
The owner can fence sources, require approval and keep real mail
as drafts. Typed

00:01:03.645 --> 00:01:08.899
stakeholders and deterministic templates decide who can be
contacted and what is sent. A

00:01:08.899 --> 00:01:14.153
hostile email cannot change those permissions. The public broker
uses an audited application allowlist;

00:01:14.153 --> 00:01:16.780
OpenShell does not surround this hosted broker.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:24.245
Separate dated tests exercised actual Google Calendar review,
approval, a broker move and independent

00:01:24.245 --> 00:01:30.510
provider read-back. Actual Gmail tests created and recovered
self-addressed synthetic drafts without duplication. No

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:36.776
mail was sent; Gmail inbox interpretation was not tested. Google
access remains an owner

00:01:36.776 --> 00:01:39.461
pilot, with token continuity still open.

00:01:40.661 --> 00:01:46.171
Encrypted private Git memory holds account graphs, policies and
reusable Skills. A restored rule

00:01:46.171 --> 00:01:51.681
required approval for a later synthetic move in the policy
check. Today separates source

00:01:51.681 --> 00:01:57.190
enrollment from successful sync history. Owner Hermes enrollment
remains unfinished because the local gateway

00:01:57.190 --> 00:02:01.126
failed its bridge probe. No always-on owner workflow is claimed.

00:02:02.326 --> 00:02:08.371
The recorded seven-case live evaluation resolved every scenario.
Ultra supplied the only feasible proposal

00:02:08.371 --> 00:02:14.417
in the overlap case, but won only two cases overall; three of
eleven proposals

00:02:14.417 --> 00:02:20.462
passed every gate. Deterministic fallback remains essential.
Explore the free credential-free replay, dated evidence

00:02:20.462 --> 00:02:24.780
and licensed source at dira nemetron. Dira keeps commitments
